  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILO BOUZOUR - Building inclusive markets and decent work in Lebanon - Old Strategy- ILO - Promoting decent jobs in Lebanon</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ILO BOUZOUR - inkluderande marknader och f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrade arbetsvillkor i Libanon.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) Increased productivity and decent working conditions in the covered
horticulture sector.
2) Farmers and agribusinesses connected to new market opportunities
3) Farmers enabled to use solar energy systems for electricity generation
4) Farmers and small agribusinesses capacitated to better manage their activities
and resources

Final beneficiaries will be host communities and refugee workers and specifically those
operating in the wider agriculture and renewable energy sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsens m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra jordbrukets produktivitet, &#xf6;ppna upp f&#xf6;r nya marknader f&#xf6;r jordbruksprodukter samt att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra arbetsvillkoren..</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s aim it to increase farmers&apos; productivity, connect agri-business to new markets including decent working conditions.</narrative>
  </description>
